lg:US-CFR-16-312-4-a-q1
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion true ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:US-CFR-16-312-4-a ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:US-CFR-16-312-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/CFRGRANULE/PART[1]/SECTION[4]/P[1]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-312"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "(a) General principles of notice. It shall be the obligation of the operator to provide notice and obtain verifiable parental consent prior to collecting, using, or disclosing personal information from children. Such notice must be clearly and understandably written, complete, and must contain no unrelated, confusing, or contradictory materials."@en .

lg:US-CFR-16-312-4-d
    a lgo:Provision ;
    eli:is_part_of lg:US-CFR-16-312 ;
    lgo:citation "16 CFR § 312.4(d)" ;
    lgo:regulates lgv:PrivacyInformation ;
    lgo:requiresDisclosureOf lgv:CategoriesOfPersonalData , lgv:DataSubjectRights , lgv:EmailAddress , lgv:GeographicAddress , lgv:PhoneNumber , lgv:ProcessingPurposes , lgv:ProviderName , lgv:Recipients ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:SourceChecked ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:US-CFR-16-312-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/CFRGRANULE/PART[1]/SECTION[4]/P[29]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-312"^^xsd:anyURI .

lg:US-CFR-16-312-4-d-q1
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion true ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:US-CFR-16-312-4-d ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:US-CFR-16-312-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/CFRGRANULE/PART[1]/SECTION[4]/P[29]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-312"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "(d) Notice on the website or online service. In addition to the direct notice to the parent, an operator must post a prominent and clearly labeled link to an online notice of its information practices with regard to children on the home or landing page or screen of its website or online service, and, at each area of the website or online service where personal information is collected from children. The link must be in close proximity to the requests for information in each such area. An operator of a general audience website or online service that has a separate children's area must post a link to a notice of its information practices with regard to children on the home or landing page or screen of the children's area. To be complete, the online notice of the website or online service's information practices must state the following:"@en .

lg:US-CFR-16-312-5-a-1
    a lgo:Provision ;
    eli:is_part_of lg:US-CFR-16-312 ;
    lgo:citation "16 CFR § 312.5(a)(1)" ;
    lgo:regulates lgv:Consent ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:SourceChecked ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:US-CFR-16-312-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/CFRGRANULE/PART[1]/SECTION[5]/P[1]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-312"^^xsd:anyURI .

lg:US-CFR-16-312-5-a-1-q1
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion true ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:US-CFR-16-312-5-a-1 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:US-CFR-16-312-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/CFRGRANULE/PART[1]/SECTION[5]/P[1]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-312"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "(a) General requirements. (1) An operator is required to obtain verifiable parental consent before any collection, use, or disclosure of personal information from children, including consent to any material change in the collection, use, or disclosure practices to which the parent has previously consented."@en .

lg:US-CFR-16-312-5-a-2
    a lgo:Provision ;
    eli:is_part_of lg:US-CFR-16-312 ;
    lgo:citation "16 CFR § 312.5(a)(2)" ;
    lgo:regulates lgv:Consent ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:SourceChecked ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:US-CFR-16-312-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/CFRGRANULE/PART[1]/SECTION[5]/P[2]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-312"^^xsd:anyURI .

lg:US-CFR-16-312-5-a-2-q1
    a lgo:Quote ;
    lgo:officialLanguageVersion true ;
    lgo:quoteOf lg:US-CFR-16-312-5-a-2 ;
    lgo:retrievedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:sourceDocument lg:US-CFR-16-312-source ;
    lgo:sourceElement "/CFRGRANULE/PART[1]/SECTION[5]/P[2]" ;
    lgo:sourceUrl "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-16/chapter-I/subchapter-C/part-312"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lgo:text "(2) An operator must give the parent the option to consent to the collection and use of the child's personal information without consenting to disclosure of his or her personal information to third parties, unless such disclosure is integral to the website or online service. An operator required to give the parent this option must obtain separate verifiable parental consent to such disclosure."@en .

